   - There are several conditional checks to ensure that certain conditions are met before accessing data. For example:
     ```cpp
     if (IsSink(n)) continue;
     if (IsSwitch(n) || IsMerge(n) || IsEnter(n) || IsExit(n)) {
       requires_control_flow_ = true;
     }
     ```
